      ],
      "source": "https://felida.info/history-of-felida/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Felida lies just 7 miles north of downtown Vancouver, bordered by Salmon Creek to the east and Lake Shore to the south.",
